// An original example song written for this repository.
// A D.S. al Coda, a 6/8 bridge, a 2/4 bar and cues for one pass.

## Intro
> MD gtr, bass: Pickup on beat 4, then the riff in unison.
[p:1] 5 | R[ 1 5 b7 1 ] | 4 | R[ 1 5 b7 1 ] | 4

## Verse
> MD: Tight and low. I'll bring us back here from the bridge.
> MD 2x drums: Ride cymbal on the second pass.
|: {segno} {p} 1 "Headlights on the northbound" | 4 | 6m | 5 {2x bass: walk up}
1 | 4 | 6m 5 | [1] 4 :| 2x
[2] 4 | 4 {cresc}

## Chorus
> MD: Full band. Big and open.
{mf} 4 "Keep driving north" | 1 | 5 | 6m
4 | 1 | 5 {to coda} | 5

## Bridge
> MD: Half-time in 6/8. Watch me for the way back.
@meter 6/8
@tempo 72
{p} 6m | 4 | 1 | 5 {rit}
@meter 4/4
@tempo 84
4 | [m:2/4] 5 | 5 {D.S. al coda}

## Outro
> MD: Last time. Hold the end on my cue.
{coda} {f} 4 | 5 | 6m 5 | <1>~
